\f0\b Product Offerings & Differentiation:
\f1\b0  Most competitors carry similar core products (5\uc0\u8243  and 6\u8243  K-style gutter systems in aluminum, plus downspouts, elbows, etc.). Differentiation comes from 
\f0\b breadth of product range
\f1\b0  and 
\f0\b value-added offerings
\f1\b0 :\
